description:
**Description**

We’re looking for an experienced Test Engineer (5+ years) who can ensure applications run smoothly by analyzing requirements, creating and executing test cases, and working across portals, APIs, and banking systems.

**Mandatory Skill(s)**

* Proficiency in test automation tools such as Tosca, Selenium, Appium, or JBehave;
* Familiarity with performance testing tools (LoadRunner, JMeter) and API testing;
* Hands-on experience with test management and CI/CD tools including JIRA, Zephyr, Confluence, and DevOps pipelines;
* Basic programming or scripting knowledge (e.g., Java, SQL, or VBScript) for data validation and test automation.

**Desirable Skill(s)**

* Strong analytical, problem-solving, and stakeholder communication skills in a fast-paced environment;
* Exposure to banking domain (preferred).

**Responsibilities**

* Analyse business requirements and acceptance criteria to design end-to-end test plans, test scenarios, and test cases across functional, integration, regression, and non-functional scopes;
* Track execution in tools like Jira Zephyr, log defects, perform regression and API testing, and ensure timelines are met;
* Validate integrations across systems and collaborate with developers, product owners, and stakeholders to resolve issues.

Should you be interested in this career opportunity, please send in your updated resume to apply@sciente.com at the earliest.

When you apply, you voluntarily consent to the disclosure, collection and use of your personal data for employment/recruitment and related purposes in accordance with the SCIENTE Group Privacy Policy, a copy of which is published at SCIENTE’s website (https://www.sciente.com/privacy-policy).

Confidentiality is assured, and only shortlisted candidates will be notified for interviews.

